title: Start
---
<<declare $ren = 0 as number>>
<<declare $mika = 0 as number>>
<<declare $helped_ren = false as bool>>
<<background Square>>
It's the night of the Lantern Festival, your first since moving to town.
The square is full of light and noise. You don't know anyone yet.
<<show Ren left>>
Ren: Oh! Sorry, I almost walked right into you. You're new here, aren't you?
-> "I am. Is it that obvious?"
    <<set $ren = $ren + 1>>
    Ren: Only because you're looking at everything like it's magic. Which it is.
-> "No, I've lived here for years."
    Ren: Really? Huh. I'd remember a face like that.
    Ren: ...Okay, I'll stop teasing.
<<show Mika right>>
Mika: Ren, the lanterns won't hang themselves. Who's this?
Ren: Someone new! Be nice.
Mika: I'm always nice. I'm just busy.
-> "Can I help with the lanterns?"
    <<set $mika = $mika + 2>>
    Mika: ...You can? Fine. Hold this ladder, and don't let go.
-> "Ren was just showing me around."
    <<set $ren = $ren + 1>>
    Mika: Of course Ren was. Have fun.
    <<hide Mika>>
<<jump Stalls>>
===

title: Stalls
---
<<hide_all>>
<<background Stalls>>
Later, the food stalls open. The smell of grilled corn fills the street.
<<show Ren center>>
Ren: I lost my lantern ticket somewhere. Without it I can't send a lantern tonight.
-> "Let's look for it together."
    <<set $ren = $ren + 2>>
    <<set $helped_ren = true>>
    You search under the tables until you find it, stuck to a paper plate.
    Ren: You're my hero. Seriously.
-> "Maybe Mika has a spare?"
    Ren: Maybe. I'll ask her later.
<<hide Ren>>
<<show Mika center>>
Mika: There you are. The lantern on the bridge keeps going out.
Mika: Everyone says it's bad luck. I say it's a bad wick.
-> "Let's fix it before the countdown."
    <<set $mika = $mika + 2>>
    Mika: Now you're talking.
-> "Bad luck sounds more fun."
    <<set $mika = $mika - 1>>
    Mika: Of course you'd think so.
-> "Ren and I will fix it together." <<if $helped_ren>>
    <<set $ren = $ren + 1>>
    <<set $mika = $mika + 1>>
    Mika: Fine. Just don't set anything on fire.
<<jump Bridge>>
===

title: Bridge
---
<<hide_all>>
<<background Bridge>>
At midnight, everyone gathers on the bridge to send their lanterns up.
Who will you stand beside?
-> Ren <<if $ren >= 3>>
    <<jump RenEnding>>
-> Mika <<if $mika >= 3>>
    <<jump MikaEnding>>
-> "I'll watch from here."
    <<jump AloneEnding>>
===

title: RenEnding
---
<<show Ren center>>
Ren: I was hoping you'd pick me. Ready? On three.
Your lanterns rise together, side by side, until you can't tell them apart.
Ren: Same time next year?
<<raise RenEnding>>
===

title: MikaEnding
---
<<show Mika center>>
Mika: The bridge lantern stayed lit. Told you it was the wick.
Mika: ...Thanks for staying. Most people get bored of me.
The two of you watch the sky fill with light.
<<raise MikaEnding>>
===

title: AloneEnding
---
You watch a thousand lanterns float over the river.
Next year, maybe, you'll know someone to share it with.
<<raise AloneEnding>>
===
